---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Resources" description="Why AI safety matters, and what NU AI Safety is for.">
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Resources</h1>

      <p>
        AI systems are becoming more capable and dangerous at a rate faster than we can control
        them. Models are now able to
        <a href="https://openai.com/index/hugging-face-incident-and-the-road-ahead/">hack into other companies</a>,
        <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/research/agentic-misalignment">blackmail users</a>,
        <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.23836">know when they’re being evaluated</a>, and
        even be
        <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/disrupting-AI-espionage">used en masse for cyber espionage</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We want to give Northeastern students the tools and knowledge they need to help align and
        govern AI systems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
